<title>FRANCE: CGIP sees scope for share price rise.</title>
<headline>CGIP sees scope for share price rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>French investment holding company CGIP said on Thursday it saw potential for a considerable rise in its share price.</p>
<p>&quot;A cautious evaluation of the company's assets (2,800 francs per share before tax) provides CGIP shares ... with considerable potential to rise from their current level,&quot; CGIP said in a statement.</p>
<p>CGIP closed in Paris on Wednesday at 1,663 francs.</p>
</text>
